      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason for `-Wno` instead of `-Wno-error\u003d` is to reduce build warning spam both for developers and automated builds. Many of these warnings are not worth fixing, or they might be lower in priority than many other tasks that would be more beneficial (external/ cleanups also tend to be very slow and difficult). I\u0027m not opposed to having a mode for the build where it does use `-Wno-error\u003d` instead, but you\u0027d have to modify Soong further to support varying between these.\n\nAs written though, I have to reject this CL because the tradeoff of creating lots of build warning spam for nearly every other developer is much worse than having to hack the Soong rules to embark on cleanup CLs.",
      "revId": "407e61365cf96f6ed090abec29d4557a67d7ecba",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
